# The paper's running example {ab, aabb, aaabbb}, counts summing to 50.
# Cook et al.'s exact relative frequencies are not reprinted in the paper, so a
# decaying distribution is used; uniform counts (e.g. 17/17/16) correctly block
# the inductive leap under the Bayesian criterion (see the report).
30: a b
15: a a b b
5: a a a b b b
